; Install: GFOpenBrowser 0.8.4 test (1.11.2026), the Shell route.
; MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team.
; The Installer (Install-GFOpenBrowser, beside this drawer) does the same with
; questions. Run this from the drawer, where it stays:
;     CD <this drawer>
;     Execute Install
; Then reboot (or quit GFOpenBrowser first) and start GFOpenBrowser here.
;
; What it does; every step is checked, and it stops at the first failure:
;  - LIBS:gfopentls.library 1.2 or newer and LIBS:gfopencrypto.library 2.1 or
;    newer: a missing one goes in; one Version shows to be older is renamed
;    .before-20261101 and the drawer's goes in; one whose version cannot be
;    read (not loaded, no $VER in the file) is kept: the Installer reads
;    the RomTag and checks it;
;  - LIBS:gfopenfont.library 1.4 or newer (the engine draws its text with
;    it): missing, it goes in; older, it is renamed .before-20261101 and
;    the drawer's goes in; unreadable, it is kept, as above;
;  - LIBS:gfopengpu.library 0.24 or newer (the window is painted through
;    it; without it the engine paints with cairo): the same rules;
;  - LIBS:gfopenlayout.library 11 or newer (the window's dialogs, find bar,
;    downloads and preferences): the same rules, renamed .before-20261103;
;  - LIBS:json.library (the engine's JSON.parse needs it),
;    LIBS:unicode.library (its Unicode calls, when the package carries it)
;    and S:GFOpenTLS/ca-bundle.pem when missing;
;  - for compressed pages, LIBS:z.library 53.12 and
;    SYS:Classes/DataTypes/stream.datatype, gzip.datatype and
;    brotli.datatype 47.1 or newer, with the same rules as GFOpenTLS
;    (renamed .before-20261101 when older), and DEVS:DataTypes/GZip and
;    Brotli when missing;
;  - LOCALE:Unicode/icudt78b.dat, as the Installer does: when missing, or
;    one of another size, which is renamed icudt78b.dat.before-20261101,
;    when LOCALE: has room for it and 2,000,000 bytes more; when Info gives
;    no free space for LOCALE: (0, or nothing it can read) the copy is
;    tried, and a failure is reported;
;  - the engine stays in this drawer (Libs/WebBrowser/WebBrowserEngine,
;    with its fonts, Tata.ads and Unicode data); the 76 MB
;    engine is not copied to System:. webbrowser.library (LIBS:, or this
;    drawer's Libs) runs LIBS:WebBrowser/WebBrowserEngine when there is
;    one, otherwise this drawer's: an older LIBS:WebBrowser/WebBrowserEngine
;    (the engine, or the two-line script 0.8.0 and 0.8.1 test wrote there)
;    is renamed WebBrowserEngine.before-20261101;
;  - a GFOpenBrowser.engine left in this drawer by an older version (unpacked
;    over it) is renamed GFOpenBrowser.engine.before-20261101: the launcher
;    no longer runs it.
; Nothing is deleted.
FailAt 21
If NOT EXISTS Libs/WebBrowser/WebBrowserEngine
  Echo "Run Install from the GFOpenBrowser drawer:  CD <the drawer>  then  Execute Install"
  Quit 20
EndIf

Version gfopentls.library 1 2 >NIL:
Set vrc $RC
If $vrc EQ 0 VAL
  Echo "LIBS:gfopentls.library is new enough, kept"
  Skip tlsdone
EndIf
If $vrc GE 10 VAL
  ; no version to read: not loaded, and the file has no $VER
  If EXISTS LIBS:gfopentls.library
    Echo "LIBS:gfopentls.library is there; its version cannot be read from the Shell, so it is kept (Install-GFOpenBrowser checks it)"
    Skip tlsdone
  EndIf
Else
  Rename LIBS:gfopentls.library LIBS:gfopentls.library.before-20261101
  If WARN
    Echo "Could not rename the old LIBS:gfopentls.library; nothing changed."
    Quit 20
  EndIf
EndIf
Copy Libs/gfopentls.library LIBS: QUIET
If WARN
  Echo "Could not copy gfopentls.library to LIBS: (is LIBS: full or write-protected?)"
  Quit 20
EndIf
Echo "Installed LIBS:gfopentls.library"
Lab tlsdone

